UID:10004109-1783972800-1783985400@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:The JLloyd Monday Mashup: w/sg Natalie Brooke & Rob Geisler!
DESCRIPTION:These next two Mondays are Gonna be off the chain! Trust!\nThis week\, we have the musical ninja of keys\, Natalie Brooke with us for the night! And!… holding down the bottom line\, is Rob Geisler on Bass!\nThis will def be a fun one!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nEvent starts at 8.Music starts at 8:30.Going until 11:30ish.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n$10. Thank you for the continued support!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMashup Mondays every Monday at One World Brewing West with special guests and different music every week!!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe JLloyd MashUp explores different genres of music including Acid Jazz\, Funk\, Soul\, Afro Beat\, Reggae\, Break Beat\, and Latin. Led and curated by Jonathan Lloyd (The Fritz/Dubconscious/Cadillac Jones)\, the band is made up of some of Asheville’s busiest and hardest working musicians on the scene.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/jloyd-mashup-mondays-w-sg/
LOCATION:One World Brewing – West\, 520 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/741248694_1351109853785516_2506007858736189181_n-e1783604423639.jpg
GEO:35.5783642;-82.5848526
