X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Avl Digital Nomads": "https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/315272553/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_avl_digital_nomads
X-SOURCE:AVL Digital Nomads
UID:event_315272553@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260714T030420Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260715T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260715T193000
SUMMARY:Curated Conversations
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nHello Nomads!! For our next exciting Curat
 ed Conversations\, we will be meeting at the wonderful venue\, Day Trip do
 wntown. Once there\, take a moment to adjust to the **impeccable** **1970s
  groovy decor** and soak it in before ordering a beverage (adult or otherw
 ise). Then\, join us in the large room\, where we will begin our latest in
 stallment of Curated Conversations sharing and discussing podcasts\, books
 \, and advice we've heard and read on various subjects related to **dating
  and communication** (including some funny examples).\n\nWe will explore *
 *resources that speak to the importance of strong communication** as it pe
 rtains to dating and building healthy relationships. We invite you to **br
 ing the book(s) and/or names of podcast series or episodes** that were mos
 t impactful for you\, so others can consider how it may be useful for them
 . Don't worry\, any books you bring will go home with you! We'll share the
 m during the meeting and provide a list of all the resources shared after.
 \n\nLook for the Digital Nomads table and group of welcoming people where 
 the AVL Digital Nomad signage will be. Fill out a name tag to make introdu
 ctions easier and begin engaging with the other single remote workers.\n\n
 Bring a single friend or two who may be interested in meeting new people a
 nd **leveling up their communication skills in fun and creative ways. This
  isn't matchmaking:** it's learning communication skills to empower you fo
 r maximizing your own connections. See you there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/315272553/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260615T164657Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260615T164657Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Avl Digital Nomads": "https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/315387329/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_avl_digital_nomads
X-SOURCE:AVL Digital Nomads
UID:event_315387329@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260714T030420Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260715T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260715T200000
SUMMARY:Leadership on Tap
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nThrough an interactive activity and group 
 discussion\, attendees will see how intent-based leadership helps teams un
 derstand the mission\, make better decisions\, and take ownership of execu
 tion without waiting for constant direction.\n\nThis presentation introduc
 es a practical model for leadership that helps people stay aligned while s
 till adapting to changing conditions. Based on principles from Stephen Bun
 gay’s The Art of Action\, the session explains how leaders can move beyo
 nd command-and-control by clearly communicating purpose\, priorities\, and
  expected outcomes.\n\n**Special discount on ADN engraved Pirani cups!**\n
 **Your paid ticket gets you $10 off our 5th-anniversary custom [ADN Pirani
  cups](https://avldigitalnomads.org/meet-our-brand-new-customized-adn-pira
 ni-mugs/)! Available in 16oz\, 26oz\, and 32oz sizes\, you can select your
 s directly at this event.**\n\nEveryone! Whether you're leading in for-pro
 fit\, non-profit\, academia\, community organizations\, or entrepreneurshi
 p – or simply curious about leadership – you're welcome to join us.\n\
 n* Hatch Coworking\n* Parking: Street parking is free after 6 pm\n* Bevera
 ges: Alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/315387329/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260623T193129Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260623T193129Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
